# J4G Ops UI (Admin Shell)

Target feel: operations SaaS — dark navy sidebar, royal blue primary, attention-first, compact table density.

See [data-loading.mdc](data-loading.mdc) for async table patterns. See [ui-design.mdc](ui-design.mdc) for tokens.

## App shell

- **Dark sidebar**: `w-60 bg-sidebar` (`#1A2238`), links `text-[13px] h-9`, active `bg-brand/25 text-white`
- **Slim top bar**: `h-12 bg-white border-b` — date, notifications, `+ New order`, user menu
- **Content canvas**: `bg-surface` (`#F8F9FB`), full width `w-full px-5 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-10 xl:px-12` — no `max-w-7xl mx-auto`
- **Font**: Inter, base `text-[13px]`

## Page structure

```blade
<x-ui.page-header title="Orders">
    <x-slot:actions>
        <x-ui.button>+ New order</x-ui.button>
    </x-slot:actions>
</x-ui.page-header>

<x-ui.page-card>
    <x-slot:toolbar>...</x-slot:toolbar>
    <x-ui.async-table>...</x-ui.async-table>
</x-ui.page-card>
```

- Page title: `text-xl font-semibold`, eyebrow labels in uppercase `text-[11px] text-gray-400`
- Primary CTA: top-right in `page-header` or navbar — never full-width in toolbars

## Panels & tables

- Panel: `rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm`
- Toolbar: `px-3 py-2 border-b flex items-center gap-2`
- Table: `ui-table` — header `text-[12px] text-gray-500 bg-gray-50`, cells `px-3 py-2 text-[13px]`
- Target row height: 40–44px — avoid `px-6 py-5`

## Buttons

- Primary: `h-9 px-3 text-[13px] bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover`
- Secondary: `h-9 border bg-white hover:bg-gray-50`
- Table actions: `ui-row-action` or `ui-row-more` dropdown
- Destructive: `ui-row-action-danger` or danger variant with confirm

## Badges & status

- Soft filled pills with optional dot: green / amber / blue / purple / orange / red
- Use `<x-ui.status-pill>` or `<x-ui.badge>` — never plain text
- Warning banners: `ui-alert-warning`; blockers: `ui-alert-danger`

## Forms & modals

- Inputs: `h-9 text-[13px]`, labels `text-xs font-medium`
- Focus rings: brand blue (`focus:ring-brand/20`)
- Modal: `ui-modal-panel`, `rounded-xl`, `max-w-md` or `max-w-lg`

## Dashboard / Today

- Compact stat cards: `p-4`, label `text-xs`, value `text-xl`
- Grid: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3`
- Needs-attention list + stock health footer preferred over chart-first layout

## Do NOT

- Huge cards, big fonts, large buttons, excessive whitespace
- Heavy shadows (`shadow-xl`), `rounded-3xl`
- Marketing-page layouts
- Full-width primary buttons in toolbars
- Blade `@foreach` for large tables (use async `/data` endpoints)

## Components

`page-header`, `page-card`, `async-table`, `button`, `input`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`, `badge`, `status-pill`, `empty-state`, `stat-card`
